  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> All Ranged Weapons without a Smart Rebuild or Smartgun Link</p>\n<p><em>Not all smartguns are built the same. Quite literally, in fact.</em></p>\n<p>Adds a Smartgun Link to the weapon which does not consume any Attachment Slots, and is considered an attachment separate from this mod for the purposes of Tech Upgrades or other Weapon Mods. The weapon cannot install an additional Smartgun Link, and its newly added Smartgun Link must be properly connected to by an Interface Plug or Subdermal Grip in order for the weapon to be fired.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Weapon Mods).</em></p>"
